      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just a note, I forget when the feature was added, but with the more recent SDK (3.2 or 3.3 or newer) one thing you can do is open up any avatar project, set the pipeline ID (avatar ID) to the avatar you want to change, and just change the avatar picture there. \n\nJust don't accidentally upload that avatar over your existing one...",
