  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So 1 thing i think would be great to add to vrchat would be a way to change the pictures of your avatars through the website so if say you dont have the files to that avatar anymore and you wanna change the picture for the avatars thumbnail then possibly there could be a setting for that in the vrchat website and of course the only way to change those thumbnails is if theyre avatars you uploaded instead of someone elses creation yknow plus makes it easier for us as well in case we know of a perfect world to have our avatar pose in but dont wanna just go through uploading the avatar again just to change the picture yknow",
